{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"CONTEXT SEDIMENT — 528K / 1M used\n      \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        ACTIVE\n        STALE (growing)\n        System + Skills\n        \n        T1\n        T157\n        T314\n      \n      \n        Dead weight: 31% (164K tokens)\n        Active: 42% (222K)\n      \n    \n    \n      B — The Sediment View\n      Primary view: stacked area chart where each layer is split into \"active\" and \"stale\" portions. You see the context growing like geological sediment — and the stale layer growing thicker over time. Gives an instant \"30% of your context is dead weight\" read.\n      \n        Strengths: Best aggregate story — the growing red band is immediately alarming. Familiar chart type. Clean.\n        Weakness: Doesn't show individual blocks as clearly. Drill-down needed for recommendations.","choice":"b","id":null,"timestamp":1780275726568}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"SESSION HEALTH REPORT\n      \n        \n          31%\n          Dead Weight\n        \n        \n          53%\n          Context Used\n        \n        \n          97%\n          Cache Hit\n        \n      \n      \n        ⚠ TOP STALE BLOCKS\n        \n          Read server.py (t7) — 12.4K tok — stale 40 turns\n          Bash npm test (t12) — 8.1K tok — stale 35 turns\n          Grep imports (t15) — 4.2K tok — stale 32 turns\n        \n      \n      \n        💡 24.7K tokens recoverable by clearing stale blocks\n      \n    \n    \n      C — The Health Report\n      Primary view: scorecards showing context health at a glance — dead weight %, utilization, cache efficiency. Supporting panels list the top stale blocks with sizes and recommendations. Less exploratory, more diagnostic.\n      \n        Strengths: Most actionable — immediately tells you what to do. Clean, demo-friendly. Easy to scan.\n        Weakness: Doesn't show the temporal story as well. Less \"wow\" factor for how context evolves.","choice":"c","id":null,"timestamp":1780275727968}
